  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AWARENESS RAISING ON HUMAN TRAFFICKING AND PROVISION OF EDUCATION AND HELTH BENEFITS TO MOST VULNERABLE CHILDREN AND NEEDY ADULTS IN SINGIDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support intends to raise awareness on human trafficking and mitigage its severe effect in 18 wards of Singida Municipality with its majority being the Nyaturu tribe  who are the most vulnerable to human trafficking. The support will provide education  to people especially women and youth groups about their rights particularly Anti human trafficking, HIV &amp;AIDS, STIs, GBV, Stigma and Discrimination</narrative>
  </description>
